{"script":"wt_c3_06_1_n","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"治安队员埃尔戈瓦","text":"[show]很遗憾，粗糙鳞片的数量还不足以打造防具。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"治安队员埃尔戈瓦","text":"[show]请带来更多的鳞片吧，这样才能打造出足够的防具，我必须对那群小伙子负责。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"新队员的防具"}